SUMMARY:Live Music featuring Will Shepard at Flying Ace Farm
DESCRIPTION:Live Music featuring Veteran Will Shepard at Flying Ace Farm\nJoin us on Sunday\, September 6th\, from 2-5pm for live music featuring Will Shepard.\nMusician Bio:\nWill is a Veteran\, Loudoun County teacher\, proud father and husband\, and lives for music. He puts his twist on Americana sound and soulful melodies. He plays a large variety of songs and has been known to bring a solid energy to the people he plays for. C’mon out and hang! \n*To learn more about Will Shepard and upcoming performances\, visit his Facebook page or Instagram page.\n**Be sure to check out our Live Music Schedule at Flying Ace Farm to see all upcoming performances.\n \n \n  \n 
