SUMMARY:Live Music at Flying Ace Farm featuring Matt Burridge
DESCRIPTION:Live Music at Flying Ace Farm featuring Matt Burridge\nJoin us on Saturday\, December 26th\, from 3-6pm for live music featuring Matt Burridge.\nMusician Bio: \nMatt Burridge is a musician local to the DMV/RVA area. Currently based in Richmond\, he plays bars\, winery’s\, and private events from Maryland all the way down to the Richmond ar. In addition to playing solo cover gigs\, he writes original music\, produces under the name BD LCK\, and plays in a progressive post hardcore band called pulses. \n*To learn more about Matt Burridge and upcoming performances\, visit his website. \n**Be sure to check out our Live Music Schedule at Flying Ace Farm to see all upcoming performances. \n \n \n  \n 
