SUMMARY:Live Music at Flying Ace Farm featuring Noah "Red" Hawes
DESCRIPTION:Live Music at Flying Ace Farm featuring Noah “Red” Hawes\nJoin us on Saturday\, December 5th\, from 3-6pm for live music featuring Noah “Red” Hawes.\nNoah’s Bio: \nMy name is Noah “Red” Hawes and I’m a local performer in the Frederick area. I play acoustic arrangements of covers as well as my own originals. The covers range from singer/songwriters from the 60s and 70s like Simon and Garfunkel and James Taylor\, current pop hits from One Direction and The Chainsmokers\, and everything in between. \nI have a bachelor’s degree in classical guitar and have played lead guitar and sang vocals in classic rock\, indie\, pop punk\, and metal bands. I utilize the classical guitar training to create my acoustic arrangements of covers\, combining the elements of bass\, guitar\, and driving percussive energy all on a single guitar. \nI have a YouTube channel (Red Hawes) with original and cover videos. I have an additional channel (Drew Hawes – Noah’s Gigs with Friends) that has videos from performances with the bands I have been in\, past and present\, as well as solo performances. \n*To learn more about Noah Hawes and upcoming performances\, visit his Instagram page. \n**Be sure to check out our Live Music Schedule at Flying Ace Farm to see all upcoming performances. \n \n \n  \n 
URL:https://flyingacefarm.com/calendar/live-music-at-flying-ace-farm-featuring-noah-red-hawes/
LOCATION:Flying Ace Farm
CATEGORIES:Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://flyingacefarm.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/noah-hawes.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Flying Ace Farm":MAILTO:info@flyingacefarm.com
END:VEVENT
