SUMMARY:Live Music featuring Dylan Woelfel
DESCRIPTION:Live Music featuring Dylan Woelfel at Flying Ace Farm\nJoin us on Sunday\, December 6th\, from 2-5pm for live music featuring Dylan Woelfel.\nJoin us for live music at Flying Ace Farm on Sunday\, December 6th\, from 2–5 PM\, featuring Virginia singer-songwriter Dylan Woelfel. Enjoy an afternoon of live music alongside handcrafted American Ace Spirits\, fresh BBQ\, locally brewed beer\, and beautiful mountain views. Admission is free\, and seating is available on a first-come\, first-served basis. \nAbout Dylan Woelfel\nBorn and raised in Clarke County\, Virginia\, Dylan Woelfel is an independent singer-songwriter who has spent more than 15 years writing original music and performing throughout the Shenandoah Valley\, Winchester\, and West Virginia. Drawing inspiration from his own experiences\, Dylan blends the storytelling traditions of Outlaw Country with heartfelt folk ballads to create songs that are authentic\, honest\, and deeply personal. \nWhether performing his original music or connecting with audiences through his sincere stage presence\, Dylan delivers a memorable live performance that celebrates independent music and genuine songwriting. If you enjoy authentic country and folk music with meaningful lyrics\, you won’t want to miss this performance at Flying Ace Farm. \nTo learn more about Dylan\, check out his official Instagram page\, Facebook page as well as his music videos on YouTube page. \nBe sure to check out our full Live Music Schedule at Flying Ace Farm to see all upcoming performances throughout the year.
URL:https://flyingacefarm.com/calendar/live-musicdylan-woelfel/
LOCATION:Flying Ace Farm
CATEGORIES:Family,Free Event,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://flyingacefarm.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Dylan-Woelfel-2.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Flying Ace Farm":MAILTO:info@flyingacefarm.com
END:VEVENT
