SUMMARY:Live Music at Flying Ace Farm featuring Twofer
DESCRIPTION:Live Music at Flying Ace Farm featuring Twofer\nJoin us on Saturday\, December 12th\, from 3-6pm for live music featuring Twofer. \nMusician Bio:\nA veteran Marine Corps pilot\, Jonathan “Twofer” Noftsier is an acoustic musician known for blending country\, rock\, and pop favorites. From Tyler Childers to Avril Lavigne and Britney Spears\, his performances combine modern classics\, eclectic covers\, and nostalgic singalongs. \n*To learn more about Twofer and upcoming performances\, visit his Instagram page. \n**Be sure to check out our Live Music Schedule at Flying Ace Farm to see all upcoming performances. \n  \n 
URL:https://flyingacefarm.com/calendar/live-music-twofer/
LOCATION:Flying Ace Farm
CATEGORIES:Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://flyingacefarm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/twofer-band-photo.png
END:VEVENT
