SUMMARY:Live Music featuring Jake Phillips at Flying Ace Farm
DESCRIPTION:Live Music featuring Jake Phillips at Flying Ace Farm\nJoin us on Saturday\, December 19th\, from 3-6PM for live music by Jake Phillips. \nJake Phillips is a singer/songwriter who has traveled the world; from US and European tours to Singapore and Canada and points beyond. With a powerful voice and dynamic guitar skills\, Jake’s repertoire includes original music and an eclectic set of classic folk and alternative covers. \nRECENT NEWS: Jake’s song “Brother of Mine” debuted on SUITS LA (Season 1\, episode 10) on May 4th\, 2025. You can check out his music on Spotify\, “My Fragile Ego.” \nTo listen to more music by Jake Phillips\, check him out on Spotify  \nBe sure to check out our full Live Music Schedule at Flying Ace Farm to see all upcoming performances. \n \n \n 
